      "Sl No": 20,
      "Item Code": "WP.07.A",
      "Item Description": "WATERPROOFING WORKS {BALCONY WALL (UPTO 200 MM HIGHT)} Providing and applying integral multi-layer waterproofing treatment on vertical and horizontal surfaces of depressed portions of W.C., bathrooms, kitchens, balconies, stilts, etc., including surface preparation, cleaning, and sealing of all junctions, joints, corners and pipe penetrations, consisting of: (a) first course of cement slurry @ 4.4 kg/sqm mixed with IS:2645 approved integral waterproofing compound, applied to prepared RCC/Masonry surface, (b) second course of 20 mm thick cement plaster in 1:3 (1 cement : 3 coarse sand) mixed with waterproofing compound in recommended proportion, including rounding off the junction of vertical and horizontal faces, (c) third course of three coats of polymer modified slurry/face concrete, each coat mixed with neat cement as per manufacturer’s instructions to ensure dense impermeable surface, and (d) fourth course of 10 mm thick protective cement plaster in 1:4 (1 cement : 4 coarse sand) mixed with waterproofing compound, finishing smooth, including curing, all scaffolding, labour, tools and tackles, handling of materials, making good adjoining surfaces, ensuring watertightness and completing the treatment in all respects, all conforming to IS:2645 and manufacturer’s specifications, as directed by the Engineer-in-Charge."
